# Next.js

- App Router under `src/app/`; shared UI in `src/components/`
- Use `next/link` for internal routes (respects `basePath`)
- Static export only: no server actions, no default `next/image` optimizer
- Production Pages build: `npm run build:pages` → writes `docs/`
- Prefer server components by default; add `"use client"` only when needed
